  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/89/15"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/1"/>Righteousness and justice
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/2"/>are the foundations of Your throne,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/3"/>kindness and truth precede Your Presence.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/55/15"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/4"/>For together let us take sweet counsel;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/5"/>into the House of God
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/6"/>let us walk with the throngs.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/95/5"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/7"/>For the sea is His, and He made it;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/8"/>and the dry land, His hands formed.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:job/12/10"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/9"/>For in His hand
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/10"/>is the soul of every living thing,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/11"/>and the spirit of all human flesh.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/12"/>The soul is Yours,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/13"/>and the body is Your doing,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/14"/>have pity on Your work.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/15"/>The soul is Yours, and the body is Yours,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/16"/>Adonoy! Act [on our behalf]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/17"/>for the sake of Your Name.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/18"/>We have come [relying] on Your Name,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/19"/>Adonoy! Act [on our behalf]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/20"/>for the sake of Your Name.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/21"/>For the sake of the glory of Your Name,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/22"/>for gracious and merciful Almighty
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/23"/>is Your Name,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/24"/>For the sake of Your Name, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:tzedeq_umishpat_mekhon/25"/>pardon our iniquity, for it is great.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
